493343,0.03875444,0.01812246,0.18218173,-0.03861972,0.02572812,0.07967218,-0.01736478,-0.02791458,0.01021819,0.00700358,0.04144648,0.01190701,0.0876542,0.00520771,0.02373619,0.05376518,-0.02750011,-0.03718586,0.02231795,-0.0208801,0.06348761,-0.00690883,-0.03994641,-0.02119958,0.12587705,-0.0008582,0.024459,-0.04095526,0.01263473,0.0381912,-0.01070284,0.0165453,-0.04225596,-0.01385119,0.02909412,0.02216269,-0.01023359,-0.00021613,-0.04693896,-0.07157032,0.04468068,-0.03808341,-0.01078637,0.02615653,-0.04150866],"last_embed":{"hash":"iedsb6","tokens":453}}},"last_read":{"hash":"iedsb6","at":1774939665373},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939638603,"size":4046,"at":1774939651580,"hash":"iedsb6"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia":[20,42],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#{1}":[21,25],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,28],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[29,31],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[32,34],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[33,34],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/P5GGMXKN","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/G3XAAA2A?page=1&annotation=33KACUKJ","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/G3XAAA2A?page=1&annotation=X6ES233L","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 10","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/G3XAAA2A?page=10&annotation=TIYPDDM3","line":39}],"metadata":{"Title":"Decision-making Support System for Predicting and Eliminating Malnutrition and Anemia","Authors":"Manasvi Jagadeesh Maasthi, Harinahalli Lokesh Gururaj, Vinayakumar Ravi, Basavesha D, Meshari Almeshari, Yasser Alzamil","Year":2023,"DOI":"10.2174/0118750362246898230921054021","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"In the proposed system, machine learning approaches are utilized to predict the malnutrition status of children under five years of age and anemia in men and women using old datasets and further providing a suitable diet recommendation to overcome the disease. Classification techniques are being used for malnutrition as well as anemia prediction.","Findings":"Algorithms such as Naïve Bayes classifier (NBC), Decision Tree (DT) algorithm, Random Forest (RF) algorithm, and K-Nearest Neighbor (k-NN) algorithm are utilized for prediction. The results obtained by these algorithms are 94.47%, 85%, 95.49%, and 63.15%. When compared, Naïve Bayes and random forest algorithm provided efficient results for malnutrition and anemia, respectively.","Conclusions":"Forest algorithm have shown results with high accuracy for malnutrition and anemia prediction, respectively. A web application is designed to make the usage of the application user-friendly. This application can be used in all hospitals by doctors, nutritionists, and even health workers with computer knowledge can easily use this application even without the assistance of doctors or nutritionists and it does not require a dedicated lab as it can be easily accessed on mobile phone, desktop or laptop. Once the disease is predicted, a diet recommendation is also recommended which contains the list of food that can help the patient to overcome the disease.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"iedsb6","at":1774939665192}},"smart_blocks:maasthiDecisionmakingSupportSystem2023a.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.08554699,0.03326264,-0.01535254,0.02189494,0.03081507,0.0258753,-0.03818244,0.04453989,-0.00757196,0.015609,0.02021712,-0.08032367,-0.0330481,0.03928272,0.04012047,0.00221899,0.0369822,0.03735761,-0.04995387,0.00440486,0.07604302,-0.02223599,-0.03328466,-0.03692051,0.06016755,0.00737232,-0.00888198,-0.07287159,-0.09329717,-0.20155506,0.04226741,-0.0710012,0.08502457,-0.04065531,-0.05549751,-0.00884685,0.05945544,0.06687829,-0.07478674,0.03836603,0.02578204,-0.00257748,0.03371545,0.00116097,-0.00322788,-0.02094589,-0.04357716,-0.02191714,-0.04564102,0.00102204,-0.07397043,-0.00222141,0.01436016,0.02885035,0.04148009,0.01391243,0.02332383,0.03155084,0.00844048,0.06701232,0.03911457,0.00976826,-0.19253054,0.04060414,0.03429714,0.03781454,0.01387954,-0.02144471,0.01377634,0.00780239,-0.01725136,0.05165493,0.01918648,0.08637822,-0.03761272,0.00595346,0.04831382,-0.03682153,-0.0129934,-0.021098,-0.07477362,0.07481472,-0.0292036,0.00879636,-0.02955068,-0.0135848,-0.05556523,-0.04555997,0.06117462,-0.05813392,-0.02864083,-0.0035605,-0.01693662,0.01816457,-0.05832405,0.01079478,0.0043426,-0.00653907,-0.08891352,0.10455804,-0.04578264,-0.00299445,-0.00583551,-0.03324627,0.02021921,-0.06040495,-0.03798126,-0.05536224,-0.02276483,0.01646213,0.00535929,-0.00992635,0.03497995,0.03618701,-0.07646357,0.03342113,0.10775006,0.05309549,0.00203692,0.05280791,-0.05389145,0.00897421